# getDocumentContent — Task 11 viewer read surface (architect-lane unblock)

Precedent: getTenantSettings before Task 31 (02944fc). The Task 11 document
viewer must render version content (sections in clause order, GAP blocks,
BC-1 disclaimer), but DocumentVersion only exposes contentRef — an S3 key the
browser cannot read (private SSE-KMS bucket). No content query existed.
Shipped `getDocumentContent(versionId: ID!): AWSJSON` on the M1 resolver,
which already carries the scoped tenants/* S3 grant + KMS decrypt from
Task 7 — zero new IAM.

Semantics match the diff resolver: RLS-scoped lookup (a version outside the
caller's tenant is invisible → VERSION_NOT_FOUND), S3 key comes only from the
row, '' content_ref or S3 failure → typed CONTENT_UNAVAILABLE (never a silent
empty). 5 hermetic tests appended to m1-diff.test.ts; resolver carries the
schema node dependency (9d9c90a1 rule); count pin 84→85.

